Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["NewData", "ObjectName",
 CellID->199,ExpressionUUID->"0b1651cf-4fe8-4c47-af5f-66023294bf18"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"3873b4a3-ee6d-4e39-bb54-ff2971806291"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
     "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c34fd9ea-f1da-4167-9843-41afc80b5f73"],
 "\[LineSeparator]creates a notebook holding the initialization cell that \
loads SolutionsX.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"80b112fc-ad49-42e5-bfef-275066281de7"],
 "The cell carries no user identity and no absolute paths: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["LocateData"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/LocateData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "08b8c64c-92d6-4c46-bb15-5fe0d9d20ecc"],
 "[] finds the data root relative to the notebook's own position; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Alias"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Alias", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "447155f9-8711-474b-a9ba-a74986d7c8d5"],
 " always comes from the user configuration."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->200,ExpressionUUID->"e492bfae-5cef-4b70-bc2e-c6b9175cf6d5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "4e5cd946-494c-46f5-a3bd-97ac0d33125a"],
 "[] opens a fresh notebook and writes a single cell into it, marked as an \
initialization cell. It does not evaluate that cell: you do, and then start \
working in the notebook below it."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->201,ExpressionUUID->"50549c6c-21ac-42f2-8c2e-d7b2a4b75363"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cell holds two lines -- load the package, and LocateData[]. It carries \
no absolute paths and no alias: when the notebook sits inside a Data entry \
directory (where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "58e782c2-672f-46f9-9dfe-fd9ee677231d"],
 " puts it), or at a SolutionsX repository root (PacletInfo.wl beside a Data \
directory -- the Welcome notebook's position), LocateData[] derives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$DataDirectory"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$DataDirectory", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "96a2c880-3ec4-4562-b1ad-05193fe10402"],
 " from the notebook's own position, session-only; everywhere else the \
configured values apply unchanged."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->202,ExpressionUUID->"82000043-a951-49fe-a61c-0adcbd7eb12f"],

Cell["\<\
In a front end the package load itself prints nothing: LocateData[] is the \
single display point -- the Loaded: panel and the Data status line -- and it \
reproduces the same output on every evaluation.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->203,ExpressionUUID->"8407bb52-ddad-4e53-b38d-6f6ab233e627"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Identity is never written into the cell: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Alias"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Alias", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "58cb98a1-5d03-4698-a2df-7fdba336b683"],
 " always comes from the user configuration, so a notebook passed to another \
user reads its owner's entry but saves under theirs."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->204,ExpressionUUID->"34a1ca63-fc01-4a6b-869d-cb44a27293fc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Nothing has to be switched on for parallel work: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Compute"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Compute", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "d0ba0956-1bf7-4786-ac4e-3566e9ac3b5d"],
 " evaluates the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ParallelMap"]], "paclet:ref/ParallelMap"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "1db298c4-5924-4c1f-8ed5-7af304485f39"],
 " entries of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Apply"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Apply", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "722d01b7-f84a-4ee0-a311-a1984911ebed"],
 " across the parallel kernels on its own."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->205,ExpressionUUID->"d7b661d4-218f-441e-aca7-3ac6c7c3202f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Marking the cell ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InitializationCell"]], "paclet:ref/InitializationCell"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "5f5b494c-ec5e-402b-9b14-5f5c6a57adc5"],
 " -> ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["True"]], "paclet:ref/True"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "8b1732b0-ef0b-44a5-8a32-8b966bde9da4"],
 " is what makes a stored entry self-restoring: whenever the notebook is \
reopened, the front end offers to evaluate it, which puts back the package \
and points the session at the data tree the notebook lives in."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->206,ExpressionUUID->"a89630a5-f6e3-4e62-8893-97ad68b4adff"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The intended cycle is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "b61bb66a-bffe-45d5-a714-8964a080178b"],
 "[], evaluate the initialization cell, build the solution, then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "41b863cc-4eda-4a0e-9373-eea91b66b291"],
 ", which writes the data and this notebook side by side into the entry \
directory."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->207,ExpressionUUID->"d5532baf-93aa-4dd6-b489-dd085819f3ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "cff4811e-167d-4a01-b9ca-4761967bf329"],
 " requires a front end, and returns nothing useful -- its effect is the new \
notebook."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->208,ExpressionUUID->"7f467220-48d5-42de-92b0-6bc32b3f152c"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellTags->"PrimaryExamplesSection",
 CellID->209,ExpressionUUID->"0904890b-330a-4f44-8a12-0b91dd32a041"],

